{"id":"5149","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5149_main_altocumulus-lenticularis_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这些荚状高积云在英国英格兰紧邻约克郡奔宁山脉背风面及上空形成，处于60°N 26°W附近为中心的大范围低压暖区内。该暖区的特点是稳定的西转西南气流，而在以比斯开湾上空为中心的1034-hPa反气旋的北侧周边有反气旋性曲率。</p>\n<p>这些云持续存在了几个小时（当地时间11:00至15:30），但在14:00-15:30完全形成。在此期间，最大的云形成了近乎静止的南北向云带，其轴在约克郡谷地的奔宁山脉最高峰东侧位移了大约20-30公里。卫星图像显示云顶高度在6000米（20000英尺）到7500多米（25000英尺）。英国气象局在迪什福斯和Linton-on-Ouse的激光云底记录仪探测的云底高度在5200-5500米（17000-18000英尺）。在早晨低层层积云消散后，英格兰北部广大地区上空都看到了这种云。</p>\n<p>在主云西侧（上风向）至图片右上角可见一些小区域的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波涛状云</span>（开尔文-亥姆霍兹大波）。</p>\n<p>在地平线附近可看到被强烈紊流风吹乱的晴天<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>和一块残留的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"英国，西约克郡，沃夫河谷，伯利","latitude":"纬度: 53° 54' 42'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 45' 30'' W","date":"22 December 2011 1415 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= 4, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5149_syn_altocumulus-lenticularis_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>北大西洋深低压系统与比斯开湾庞大的高压系统之间紧密的气压梯度</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5149_upper_altocumulus-lenticularis_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200UTC从英国苏格兰勒威克进行探测。遗憾的是，在距离拍摄地更近的英国英格兰阿尔伯马尔或诺丁汉郡和Watnall等台站或在英国北爱尔兰的Castor湾台站都没有1200UTC的探测资料。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5149_sat_altocumulus-lenticularis_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>2011年12月22日1330UTC的可见光卫星云图（左）和卫星反演云顶高度（右）。在可见光云图中，很难将荚状高积云与周围的层积云加以区别，但云层以东的显著投影可显示其位置，它呈南北向的窄暗带，从英国的诺森伯兰延伸到北约克郡。在云顶高度图像中，容易区分高积云，因为它的云顶高度更高，有6000多米（20000英尺），而与坎不里亚郡以西的层积云相关的云顶高度约为7000英尺（2100米），约克郡其它地区以东上空的层云和层积云云顶高度约为2000-4000英尺（600-1200米）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2011 / Met Office","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/movie_play_blue.png","title":"","description":"","copyright":"","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":"","videoSrc":"/images/compressed/tlvid/5149_tlvid_altocumulus-lenticularis_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.mp4"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4719_main_altocumulus-lenticularis-duplicatus-and-cumulus_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状高积云复云</span>的一个典型例子。有多个堆叠的荚状或杏仁形状的云片；这些云片的尺寸随着高度的增加而增加。荚状云上方<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">广泛起伏的高层云云层</span>中也反映出产生这种云的地形波。山脊后面是一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中积云和碎云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Gréta  S. Guðjónsdóttir","location":"冰岛南部","latitude":"纬度: 63° 37' 52'' N","longitude":"经度: 19° 27' 30'' W","date":"27 June 2015 2000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 4, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3 7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3 7"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4720_main_altocumulus-lenticularis-duplicatus-over-monte-fitz-roy_special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>经典的荚状高积云由荚状或杏仁形状的非常细长的斑块组成。在这个例子中有多个堆叠的云片，使其成为复云的云类。</p>\n<p>阿根廷蒙特山脉背后似乎有 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">好天气里的碎积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Fabien Gillet","location":"阿根廷圣克鲁斯省El Chaltén","latitude":"纬度: 49° 19' 53'' S","longitude":"经度: 72° 53' 11'' W","date":"05 January 2008 1333 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 4, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3 6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3 6"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4734_main_altocumulus-lenticularis-duplicatus_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc8\"><p>波状透光高层复云。阴天厚厚的卷层云中可反映出地形波，卷层云的一部分已经非常厚，足以被确定为高层云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Fabrizio Micalizzi","location":"意大利墨西拿省98066 Patti","latitude":"纬度: 38° 4' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 15° 0' 33'' E","date":"02 May 2015 1219 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 7, CH= 7","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3 8","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3 8"},{"src":"/images/compressed/6083_main_altocumulus-lenticularis-and-rotor-clouds_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc9\"><p>图为焚风事件期间安第斯山脉背风坡的地形云。照片的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中间</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右侧</span>的凸出部分是荚状波状高积云。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">可看到多个波层</span>，表明是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">复云类</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">地形卷云</span>在上方形成。一行<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云可能已在滚轴上形成</span>，它是沿水平轴旋转的空气涡旋。在照片左侧是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>云堤。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Maximiliano Viale","location":"阿根廷，内乌肯，El Cholar","latitude":"纬度: 37° 26' 35'' S","longitude":"经度: 70° 38' 31'' W","date":"31 October 2016 0514 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 8, CM= 4, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.3"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4535_main_altocumulus-lentcularis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc10\"><p>照片中可见许多小块的层积云斑块。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在1处</span>可见一堆光滑的透镜状云层元素。三个明显的波浪由纤维状元素定义，波峰位于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在2处</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>。波浪特征也在卷云中可见，位于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在5处</span>。一个强劲的短波槽正从西方逼近，当地区域在所有高度上经历着逐渐增强的西南风（照片中从右到左）。</p></div>","copyright":"© B. Colman","location":"Denali National Park, Alaska, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 63° 6' 53'' N","longitude":"经度: 151° 11' 33'' W","date":"26 May 1984 1245 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南东南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 4, CH= 1","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4471_main_altocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc11\"><p>位于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1处</span>的大片云区是高空（估计离地8000米）山地波云的示例，因此它很可能主要或完全由冰晶组成。从这片云以及更远处同一高度范围更广的荚状高积云<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云体</span>的纤维状结构，也能推断出此类云的存在。由于云体大部分显示出非常明显的明暗对比，这些云被归类为高积云。该云团中伸展的结构明显暗示了波动运动。位于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3处</span>的丝状卷云斑块也是波动引发的，但缺乏清晰的荚状外观。北美南北走向的大陆分水岭位于其西侧30公里处。空中还有一条喷流<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">凝结尾迹</span>和一小片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>。高空风来自西北方向，从山顶高度附近的20米/秒增强到平均海平面上9000米高度的35米/秒，并伴有强反气旋切变。</p>\n<p>C<sub>L</sub> = 5, C<sub>M</sub> = 4, C<sub>H</sub> = 1</p></div>","copyright":"© J.M. Brown","location":"Boulder, Colorado, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 40° 0' 54'' N","longitude":"经度: 105° 16' 14'' W","date":"06 December 1979 1515 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 4, CH= 1","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4467_main_altocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc12\"><p>部分透镜状斑块在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处中心区域呈深色阴影，且未显示出细微结构；另一些则无阴影，部分由小型圆形<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">元素</span>构成。高积云的透镜形状极可能是由地形引起的驻波所致。高积云上方存在一些纤细的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>丝缕，以及一道延伸至地平线的薄纱状卷层云。当时观测的天空处于海洋极地气团中，伴有强劲的西南风，位于暖锋型锢囚锋前方500公里处。</p></div>","copyright":"© G.A. Clarke","location":"Aberdeen, Aberdeenshire, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland","latitude":"纬度: 57° 13' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 56'' W","date":"29 October 1927 1510 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 4, CH= 6","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}